[{"title":"送萧参戎柔以解职还里四首 其二","author":"释函是","text":"家学深知宿世因，不妨疑著系铃人。\n退身岂为莼鲈美，药圃芸轩别是春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":44963,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送萧参戎柔以解职还里四首 其三","author":"释函是","text":"想到家园春未归，桔槔转处识邻扉。\n儿童远近争相认，郎将于今易野衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":44964,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送萧参戎柔以解职还里四首 其四","author":"释函是","text":"与君本是旧同条，缁素论交意气饶。\n莫惜江山分手处，灵光相对未应遥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":44965,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寒食二首 其一","author":"释函是","text":"山中寒食觉春深，一样春山几样心。\n杜宇自啼花自落，白云终日覆层阴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":44966,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寒食二首 其二","author":"释函是","text":"水流乱石杂溪声，鸟啄残红照月明。\n春色自来无去住，垂杨何故动人情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":44967,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"庚戌春夜梦坐栖贤桥听泉山月朗甚独步成诗觉起索火书之仅记后二语因足成截句以志一时情景","author":"释函是","text":"金井桥边夜月深，何人梦里听寒吟。\n洪泉万古流无尽，孤负嫦娥一片心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":44968,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"前诗既成风雨拥窗就枕未能再题一首","author":"释函是","text":"濛濛春雨万峰深，别有清光寄夙心。\n收拾閒情付明月，寒炉拥被又成吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":44969,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初住归宗四首 其一","author":"释函是","text":"东晋开先代有人，复生松转劫前春。\n遥思八十年来事，艰钜难辞是此身。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":44970,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初住归宗四首 其二","author":"释函是","text":"吾师设利在金轮，四十年前话转新。\n不道无禅谁独念，祖翁田地久生尘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":44971,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初住归宗四首 其三","author":"释函是","text":"岭南獦獠自丹霞，楖栗横挑千里赊。\n多少儿孙怜老大，不知何地是吾家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":44972,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初住归宗四首 其四","author":"释函是","text":"最是堪伤法运衰，门庭通显作生涯。\n欲持一勺鸾溪水，洒向诸方热面皮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":44973,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"复生松四首 其一","author":"释函是","text":"太薇夙植岁寒心，移覆祇园大树阴。\n不向人间轻一死，鸾溪桥北早成林。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":44974,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"复生松四首 其二","author":"释函是","text":"八十年前事莫论，轻烟重见吐灵根。\n磊磊满腹谁堪委，历尽冰霜到石门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":44975,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"复生松四首 其三","author":"释函是","text":"莫誇地久与天齐，偃盖谁为树下栖。\n更欲影连高顶上，龙蛇千尺动辰奎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":44976,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"复生松四首 其四","author":"释函是","text":"神爽登临匪一丘，万年香火肇青牛。\n遥思负铁人何在，十里香回紫柏秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":44977,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题金轮峰塔院四首 其一","author":"释函是","text":"日悬午塔无中影，峰绕群峦见独尊。\n恩大莫酬尘刹梦，数间茆屋护柴门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":44978,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题金轮峰塔院四首 其二","author":"释函是","text":"当年曾忆掩关人，今日空怜守塔身。\n背面烟霞无透路，纸窗寒坐旧时春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":44979,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题金轮峰塔院四首 其三","author":"释函是","text":"第一峰头彻底贫，重来且莫辨疏亲。\n檐楹星月年年绕，不信尘中坚密身。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":44980,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题金轮峰塔院四首 其四","author":"释函是","text":"吾犹昔人非昔人，欲话难酬旷劫春。\n叶落归根他日事，只今谁与续前因。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":44981,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"米顾二使者入山二首 其一","author":"释函是","text":"天使光临满院春，入门便是个中人。\n三生石上藤萝月，万劫难忘此日因。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":44982,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"米顾二使者入山二首 其二","author":"释函是","text":"万里天威在目前，灵山付嘱尚依然。\n寒岩牛火家风旧，清涕垂垂没后先。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":44983,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送泽萌后堂住玉川门二首 其一","author":"释函是","text":"法季息机真哲者，两年相傍住帘泉。\n移茅又欲临高壑，先我寻山得玉川。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":44984,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送泽萌后堂住玉川门二首 其二","author":"释函是","text":"谁道金轮胜紫霄，溪摇松竹晚萧萧。\n避人别有深云路，不许时流候牧樵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":44985,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮春三首 其一","author":"释函是","text":"桃红柳绿送春归，雨细风微昼掩扉。\n睡起一杯千沸水，神深智浅世情违。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":44986,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮春三首 其二","author":"释函是","text":"雨过牡丹姿未减，半酣妃子倚春风。\n沉香亭北皇家事，替得山中十日穷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":