ext":"山南溪北见花开，曾逐东风舞万回。\n幸自雪霜无著处，莫因憔悴忆章台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45012,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"衰柳二首 其二","author":"释函是","text":"早知寒至傲秋风，月落山堂影已空。\n赤体每怜松柏苦，春来依旧拂墙东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45013,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"醉梅","author":"释函是","text":"暗香偏在野人家，鹤过寒空映晚霞。\n洁白却宜微著酒，不妨篱落自疏斜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45014,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"因峰顶侍者偶忆往事走笔寄晦林禅师二首 其一","author":"释函是","text":"博峤经营三十年，儿孙无力愧前贤。\n当时只道山头在，回首斜阳草漫芊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45015,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"因峰顶侍者偶忆往事走笔寄晦林禅师二首 其二","author":"释函是","text":"何年交臂频相失，忆别家山恼乱中。\n三峡桥头逢信使，不辞千里寄同风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45016,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"非影慧潜行乞馀干临别示诗二首 其一","author":"释函是","text":"我病偷閒且闭关，相劳为众往他山。\n调心多是近人处，抗互俱非大似顽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45017,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"非影慧潜行乞馀干临别示诗二首 其二","author":"释函是","text":"老怀恃此强为安，兄弟同心耐