","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45024,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岳监寺出世未及亲辞乃翁今相寻入山年适七十父子乐甚赋诗为寿二首 其一","author":"释函是","text":"匡岳寻儿已古稀，云中相见各依依。\n昔年未遂裴休愿，今日追欢尽意归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45025,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岳监寺出世未及亲辞乃翁今相寻入山年适七十父子乐甚赋诗为寿二首 其二","author":"释函是","text":"五老亭亭靠紫霄，高低群绕万峰遥。\n儿孙既有儿孙福，长劫还他祖父娇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45026,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜坐","author":"释函是","text":"云散青霄露碧空，何如片片罥玲珑。\n但知彻体无遮处，月落平原万里同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45027,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春草二首 其一","author":"释函是","text":"春草篱边绿未休，王孙去后鹧鸪愁。\n声声只唤哥哥字，万里秋原易白头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45028,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春草二首 其二","author":"释函是","text":"年年只见绿初肥，万里天涯生事违。\n莫道芳菲平野尽，五陵游侠马蹄稀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45029,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四季雁四首 其一","author":"释函是","text":"柳线初垂归计忙，平沙万里是吾乡。\n休言南国劳生事，不度潼关漫度量。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45030,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四季雁四首 其二","author":"释函是","text":"黄云如雾旧生涯，回首南洲道路赊。\n饮啄已为忘客苦，飞鸣不觉夕阳斜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45031,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四季雁四首 其三","author":"释函是","text":"西风初动望衡阳，却怪衔芦机未忘。\n斜度大江秋水怯，一行倒影入寒塘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45032,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四季雁四首 其四","author":"释函是","text":"楚原千里稻粱肥，掩映芦花好息机。\n犹自孤鸿深夜戍，一声高向白云飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45033,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送尘异但子归省二首 其一","author":"释函是","text":"与汝同撑大法船，莫随风力把头先。\n洪波险阔篙心稳，万丈厓门蓦箭穿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45034,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送尘异但子归省二首 其二","author":"释函是","text":"老去骊歌不好听，此生知有再趋庭。\n下阶更莫频回顾，法界如今世念停。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45035,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"孤吟三首 其一","author":"释函是","text":"道衰无侣自孤吟，时向林间坐夜深。\n情见两忘谁共语，等閒辜负昔人心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45036,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"孤吟三首 其二","author":"释函是","text":"草深堂下日沉沉，铁壁银山若个任。\n晚近不生真法器，床头高挂伯牙琴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45037,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"孤吟三首 其三","author":"释函是","text":"不是无心为后昆，都缘惭负昔时闻。\n羚羊挂角无踪迹，一簇金羁向白云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45038,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋江","author":"释函是","text":"浅水明沙照影亲，一时风起失前人。\n须知只在洪波里，稳卧江芦狎钓纶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":45039,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]